# permalink-svc

Pages for permalink-svc are addressed by a slug in the URL: /p/<slug>.

A slug is one or more characters, each a lowercase letter a-z, a digit 0-9, or a hyphen. Nothing else: no spaces, uppercase, slashes, dots or punctuation. The slug is the whole string, not a part of it.

## Validation

isValidSlug(slug) returns true only when the whole string is a valid slug. pagePath rejects anything else.

## Reserved slugs

A few slugs (new, edit, admin, api) are reserved for the app's own routes and cannot be used for a page.

